        "section": "numerical-methods",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Linear Systems",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STABILITY: Backward stable with partial pivoting (Wilkinson's theorem).\n  Growth factor bounded: max_{i,j}|U_{ij}| <= 2^{n-1} max_{i,j}|A_{ij}| in worst case (practically never an issue)."
    }
